{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-vicloon-baby-teether-sold-via-amazon-2609-0011","content_id":"6adb3896-4da5-4ac1-b58e-41d7e9e3a142","description":"Product Safety Report for Vicloon Baby Teether presenting a serious risk of asphyxiation.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"e10c89a5-4834-4f8b-b56e-017ff86178b3","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-04T15:34:03+01:00","id":"e10c89a5-4834-4f8b-b56e-017ff86178b3","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-09-04T15:34:03+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a9ad6dbf5b35599aec19251/2609-0011-product-safety-report-vicloon-baby-teether.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Vicloon Baby Teether sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of asphyxiation as the lion-shaped protrusion from the teether has excessive dimensions.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border, and the listing removed by the online marketplace.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Childcare articles and children’s equipment - Pacifiers/Teething Rings</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Vicloon</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>329152</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASINs</td>\n      <td>B0B2DC5M1L, B0BHQX9XCC, B0BHQZ7LF8, B0BHQWY1RG, B0BN3C81NB, B0B2DB4RF7</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Purple silicone baby teether bracelet with cover. The product label states “baby teething glove.”</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_e10c89a5-4834-4f8b-b56e-017ff86178b3\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a9ad6dbf5b35599aec19251/2609-0011-product-safety-report-vicloon-baby-teether.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The lion-shaped protrusion on the bracelet teether can be inserted too far into an infant’s mouth due to its excessive dimensions. This presents a serious risk of asphyxiation due to the protrusion potentially obstructing the airway, preventing normal breathing.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2609-0011</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-04T14:34:26Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"childcare-articles-childrens-equipment","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-09-04","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-09-04T15:34:26+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-vicloon-baby-teether